We only have klaku, which requires tears.  I don't normally produce
tears when I cry, and the babies can cry for hours without producing
any at all.

I've been using {dunku krixa} for the babies, but I myself
frequently cry (as in, my internal physiological experience is that
of crying) without sound or tears.

{dunku krixa} will do for most purposes, but I thought people might
want to play with it.

-Robin

